message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Zisu Investment Analysis"
abstract: >-
  An agentic equity-research framework that constrains LLM hallucination
  through typed value contracts and fail-closed gates. Provides an 8-phase
  analysis pipeline, 25 programmatic gates across 5 quality stages,
  reverse-DCF guardrails, four public forensic accounting models,
  and an evaluation harness with fault injection.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
